class Solution { public String complexNumberMultiply(String num1,String num2){int[] first=parse(num1),second=parse(num2);int real=first[0]*second[0]-first[1]*second[1],imaginary=first[0]*second[1]+first[1]*second[0];return real+"+"+imaginary+"i";}private int[] parse(String value){int plus=value.indexOf('+');return new int[]{Integer.parseInt(value.substring(0,plus)),Integer.parseInt(value.substring(plus+1,value.length()-1))};} }
